Z||000002||stimpy||02-27-2001||10:26 AM||||Phew, 25!!! classes for a regional show? Obviously y'all are doing something right to get that many entries. Are you really going to have that many 100% original Fiero to pick a "Best"?<BR>We at the Fiero Club of Oklahoma have been batting around this thorny issue. Last year we wound up with more trophys then entrants out of a desire to keep everyone happy. Result? Not too many people were happy.<BR>This year we are narrowing the classes.<BR>Original Notchback (all years) 1st & 2nd<BR>Original Fastback 1st & 2nd<BR>Modified Notch 1st & 2nd<BR>Mdified Fastback !st & 2nd (Modified designates 3 significant changes from stock.)<BR>Exotic 1st & 2nd (Rebodies, Mera, Pace Car, engine swaps)<BR>Daily driver 1st & 2nd||||reg||1
